+contract/viola-adopt-refusals/not-resumed · viola adopt refusals · not-resumed — A child that ends before its session resumed is refused with exit 1: `unable: <name>'s session did not resume` then `hint: check the session id - claude --resume <id> must open it by hand, under the same claude config`; `<id>` is a literal word, the session id in no line.
 contract/viola-adopt-refusals/session-live · viola adopt refusals · session-live — A session open in another `claude` is refused with exit 1 and no child started: `unable: that session is open in another claude` then `hint: close it there first, then adopt it again`.
